  "reference": "Ogokora Kw’abatomwa 24",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okogambigwa gwa Paulo ase obosio bwa Feliki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amatuko atano, Anania, Omokuani omonene, agatirimboka amo nabande b’abagaaka na Omokuani oyomo, Teritulo; barabwo bagateebereria gabana amang’ana igoro ya Paulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Teritulo achia korangerigwa, agachaaka komosoera, agateeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pi"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aye, omosike Feliki, ase okogamba kwao twanyorire omorembe omonge, na ase okorigereria kwao gwakoreire egesaku giaito ebinto ebinge ebiya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaki iga tokobinyora kera ekero na kera aase, na gokoakera ng’a mbuya mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tinkogochanda kobua, nagosoroire ototegerere ase amang’ana amake ase ogwancha kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki twanyorire omonto oyo ng’a nomochege are, na omochaaki bw’eriomana ase Abayahudi abare ase ense yonsi, naende nomotang’ani bw’ekeombe ki’Abanazareti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nigo ateemete kogindia Hekalu riko. Ase ayio tokamobwata, [tokarigia komogambia ase amachiiko aito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Lisia, omochiki omonene bw’abarwani, agaika, akamorusia ase amaboko aito ne chinguru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agachiika abamosoeri baria bache ase ore.] Aye omonyene nonyare komoboria, onyore engencho y’amang’ana onsi twamosoereire intwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi nabarabwo bakamosoera, bakaboora ng’a amang’ana ayio naboigo are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio gabana akarutera Paulo okoboko erinde akwane. Paulo akairaneria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Amaene namanyire ng’a aye kwabeire omogambi ase egesaku eke ase ekero ki’emiaka emenge, igo ninyare gwekengera ase omoyo bw’omosasoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki buna oranyare komanya, amatuko taraeta kobua ikomi na abere korwa ekero natiirete kogenda Yerusalemu gosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba tibanyoreti nkoamererania na monto, gose koburukania omosangererekano ase Hekalu ime, nonya nase chisinagogi gose ase omochie ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose tibakonyara koorokia amang’ana aya bansoera bono ng’a namaene are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ring’ana eri ndaorokie ase ore, ng’a ase enchera eyio bakoroka ensemo y’ogweatanana, inche nigo nkomosaisima Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaito, na kwegena ayariikire ase amachiiko na ase chibuku chi’ababani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninde nogosemeria ase Nyasae buna barabwo bare nakorokwo, ng’a okobokigwa kw’abakuure nakobe ase abanyene oboronge, na ase abatari abanyene oboronge boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche boigo nateemire koba nenkoro etari kongambia ase obosio bwa Nyasae, na ase obosio bw’abaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono yaetire emiaka etai meke ngacha ndetere abanto b’egesaku kiane ebiegwa, naende indue chisadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero narenge gokora aya, bakaanyora ime ase Hekalu nesibirie, timbeti nomoganda gose rirorooche. Korende Abayahudi bande, abarwete Asia mbarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo mbagwenerete koba aiga ase obosio bwao na gonsoera, onye bare ne ring’ana igoro ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose abanto aba bare aa abanyene bateebe nkomocha ki banyorete ase ’nde ekero natenena ase ekegambero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otatiga ase engencho ye ring’ana erimo nateebete neriogi rinene, ekero natenenete egati yabo. Ngateba: Ase engencho y’okobokigwa kw’abakuure nakio nkogamberigwa ase obosio bwaino iga reero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Feliki ogotiga ekiina keraare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Feliki, ekiagera amanyete boronge amang’ana ’Enchera eria, agatiga ekiina keraare, akabora: “Lisia, omochiki omonene bw’abarwani karatirimboke, rirorio ninyigwe amang’ana aino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachiika omotang’ani oria bw’abarwani rigana arende Paulo, korende amoe ribaga rike, gose tamokania nonya noyomo bw’abasani baye komokorera, gose gocha komorora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amatuko atari make, Feliki agaika na Durusila mokaye, oyorenge Omoyahudi. Akarangeria Paulo, akamoigwa ogokwana amang’ana igoro y’okomwegena Kristo Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Paulo are gokwana amang’ana igoro y’oboronge, na okweriita, na ekiina kegochi‐gocha, Feliki akaba nobwoba, akamoteebia: “Ase ekero eke bono, karagenda; ekero ndanyore ribaga, ninkorangerie naende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nayio nigo asemeretie ng’a naegwe chifeta na Paulo. Nabo akana‐komorangeria ekero ase ekero gokwana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende emiaka ebere koyaerire, Porikio Festo agasoa obogambi ribaga ria Feliki; na Feliki akarigia gwekora omuya ase Abayahudi, agatiga Paulo osibire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
